<title>USA: LXE committee recommends holders ok offer.</title>
<headline>LXE committee recommends holders ok offer.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>LXE Inc said Wednesday that a special committee of LXE's board recommended that its shareholders accept Electromagnetic Sciences Inc's stock swap offer.</p>
<p>On October 3, Electromagnetic Sciences proposed offering 0.75 shares of its common stock in exchange for each outstanding share of LXE's common stock that it does not already own.</p>
<p>Electromagnetic currently owns about 81 percent of LXE's outstanding shares.</p>
<p>Electromagnetic Sciences launched the exchange offer on November 27. The offer will expire at midnight on December 30.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
